{"ticker":"TSN","updated":"2026-10-24T00:22:18Z","profile":{"longName":"Tyson Foods, Inc.","shortName":"Tyson Foods, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Farm Products","country":"United States","website":"https://www.tysonfoods.com","fullTimeEmployees":133000,"marketCap":19947145216,"trailingPE":35.0,"forwardPE":14.555144,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.35815609,"pegRatio":1.04,"targetMeanPrice":63.0,"targetHighPrice":75.0,"targetLowPrice":56.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.001,"earningsGrowth":2.041,"grossMargins":0.06554,"operatingMargins":0.02711,"profitMargins":0.01031,"totalRevenue":55694000128,"beta":0.395,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":69.48,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":49.96,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.57},"summary":"Tyson Foods, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as a food company worldwide. It operates through four segments: Beef, Pork, Chicken, and Prepared Foods. The company processes live fed cattle and hogs; fabricates dressed beef and pork carcasses into primal and sub-primal meat cuts, as well as case ready beef and pork, and fully cooked meats; raises and processes chickens into fresh, frozen, and value-added chicken products, including breaded chicken strips, nuggets, patties, and other ready-to-fix or fully cooked chicken parts; and supplies poultry breeding stock. It also manufactures and markets frozen and refrigerated food products, including ready-to-eat sandwiches, flame-grilled hamburgers, Philly steaks, pepperoni, bacon, breakfast sausage, turkey, lunchmeat, hot dogs, flour and corn tortilla products, appetizers, snacks, prepared meals, ethnic foods, side dishes, meat dishes, breadsticks, and processed meats under the Tyson, Jimmy Dean, Hillshire Farm, Ball Park, Wright, Aidells, Gallo Salame, ibp, and State Fair brands. The company sells its products through its sales staff to grocery retailers, grocery wholesalers, meat distributors, warehouse club stores, military commissaries, industrial food processing companies, chain restaurants or their distributors, live markets, international export companies, and domestic distributors who serve restaurants and food s","summary_zh":"泰森食品公司及其子公司作為一家食品公司在全球範圍內運營。它透過四個部門運作：牛肉、豬肉、雞肉和預製食品。該公司加工活飼牛和生豬；將經過處理的牛肉和豬肉屠體加工成原始和次原始肉塊，以及盒裝牛肉和豬肉以及完全煮熟的肉類；將雞肉飼養並加工成新鮮、冷凍和增值雞肉產品，包括麵包屑雞條、雞塊、肉餅和其他即用型或完全煮熟的雞肉部分；並供應家禽種畜。該公司還生產和銷售冷凍和冷藏食品，包括即食三明治、火焰烤漢堡、費城牛排、義大利辣香腸、培根、早餐香腸、火雞、午餐肉、熱狗、麵粉和玉米餅產品、開胃菜、零食、預製餐、民族食品、配菜、肉類菜餚、麵包棒和加工肉類，旗下有泰森食品、吉米迪恩食品、Hillshire Farm、Ball Park、Wossright、Ballco、Wycoright 品牌、Wags Fair、Hillshire Farm、Ballco、Wot）。該公司透過其銷售人員將其產品銷售給雜貨零售商、雜貨批發商、肉類經銷商、倉儲俱樂部商店、軍事小賣部、工業食品加工公司、連鎖餐廳或其經銷商、生鮮市場、國際出口公司以及為餐館和食品公司提供服務的國內經銷商。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"農產品","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":57.4,"h":57.55,"l":56.96,"c":57.46,"v":2159800},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":57.25,"h":57.49,"l":56.88,"c":57.23,"v":4071100},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":57.09,"h":57.55,"l":57.02,"c":57.43,"v":1869000},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":57.42,"h":57.44,"l":55.51,"c":56.12,"v":3289900},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":55.86,"h":56.87,"l":55.73,"c":56.78,"v":2591500},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":56.72,"h":56.9,"l":56.15,"c":56.54,"v":2675000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":56.37,"h":56.54,"l":55.41,"c":56.35,"v":3287100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":56.5,"h":56.57,"l":55.97,"c":56.18,"v":1946100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":56.11,"h":56.68,"l":55.7,"c":56.2,"v":2013500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":55.77,"h":56.07,"l":55.36,"c":55.9,"v":2860600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":55.7,"h":56.08,"l":55.6,"c":55.84,"v":2235400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":55.6,"h":55.68,"l":54.82,"c":55.42,"v":2197200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":55.77,"h":56.43,"l":55.55,"c":56.08,"v":2932600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":56.02,"h":56.07,"l":55.11,"c":55.13,"v":2357200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":55.28,"h":55.38,"l":53.91,"c":54.0,"v":2712000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":54.05,"h":54.62,"l":53.79,"c":54.34,"v":2944500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":54.35,"h":54.81,"l":54.06,"c":54.12,"v":2303200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":53.95,"h":54.31,"l"