le":"Tyson Sells Assets to Lexington as City Seeks New Industry at Beef Plant Site","src":"DTN Progressive Farmer","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNU2czWFlrVldqa3BCTGpuekJpNllNWURTU0JmclZPejZXZWxLLWNpWjhMa2JGVlZPcWo4VjBCTVlRcmxMdXF5RjN4S2JxcnhrRlVGZDNfR29Qa2JVUlBydG15NXZIMHNLX1ZUMldRZ0VEMU5HalVDbXpKUUM2N1p6MERlaTYtSTM5T0JCLUZwS094ZTNLdFhMRTVaVnFSTlZDakMwUUtwSHNKOU1iQ1dCa0tMalk?oc=5","date":"2026-10-16","zh":"泰森將資產出售給列剋星敦，因該市在牛肉廠址尋求新產業"}],"themes":[{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-11-10","period":"2025-09-27","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/100493/000010049325000095/tsn-20250927.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Tyson Foods, Inc. and its subsidiaries (collectively, the \"Company,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" \"Tyson Foods\" or \"Tyson\") (NYSE: TSN) is a world-class food company and recognized leader in protein. Founded in 1935 by John W. Tyson, it has grown under four generations of family leadership. The Company is unified by this purpose: Tyson Foods. We Feed the World Like Family and has a broad portfolio of iconic products and brands including Tyson , Jimmy Dean , Hillshire Farm , Ball Park , Wright , State Fair , Aidells and ibp . Tyson Foods is dedicated to bringing high-quality food to every table in the world, safely, and affordably, now and for future generations. Headquartered in Springdale, Arkansas, the Company had approximately 133,000 employees (\"team members\") on September 27, 2025. Through its Core Values, Tyson Foods strives to operate with integrity, create value for its shareholders, custo","zh":null},{"en":"We operate a fully vertically-integrated chicken production process. Our integrated operations consist of breeding stock, contract farmers, feed production, processing, further-processing, marketing and transportation of chicken and related specialty products, including animal and pet food ingredients. Through our wholly-owned subsidiary, Cobb-Vantress, we are one of the leading poultry breeding stock suppliers in the world. Investing in breeding stock research and development allows us to breed into our flocks the characteristics found to be most desirable.","zh":null},{"en":"We also process live fed cattle and hogs and fabricate dressed beef and pork carcasses into primal and sub-primal meat cuts, case-ready beef and pork and fully-cooked meats. In addition, we derive value from specialty products such as hides and variety meats sold to further processors and others.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Walmart Inc. accounted for approximately 18.7% of our fiscal 2025 consolidated sales. Sales to Walmart Inc. were included in all of our segments. Any extended discontinuance of sales to this customer could, if not replaced, have a material impact on our operations. No other single customer or customer group represented more than 10% of fiscal 2025 consolidated sales.","zh":null},{"en":"Our food products compete with those of other food producers and processors and certain prepared food manufacturers. Additionally, our food products compete in markets around the world. We seek to achieve a leading market position for our products via our principal marketing and competitive strategy, which includes:","zh":null}],"competition":[{"en":"Our food products compete with those of other food producers and processors and certain prepared food manufacturers. Additionally, our food products compete in markets around the world. We seek to achieve a leading market position for our products via our principal marketing and competitive strategy, which includes:","zh":null},{"en":"Past efforts indicate customer demand can be increased and sustained through application of our marketing strategy, consumer insights, strong analytics to optimize efforts and supported by our distribution systems. The principal competitive elements are advertising, consumer and trade promotions, price, product safety and quality, brand identification, innovation, breadth and depth of product offerings, availability of products, customer service and credit terms.","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-09-27","items":[{"name":"Beef","val":21623000000,"zh":"Beef"},{"name":"Chicken","val":16837000000,"zh":"Chicken"},{"name":"Prepared Foods","val":9930000000,"zh":"Prepared Foods"},{"name":"Pork","val":5781000000,"zh":"Pork"}],"total":54441000000}},"peers":["HRL","CAG","CPB","GIS","ADM"]}}